1
00:00:01,719 --> 00:00:05,129
So… do you have any game
for me to play?

2
00:00:05,129 --> 00:00:08,361
No. Do you think I see you
as a kid or what— hey!

3
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:16,219
Fine, I'll just sit still then.

4
00:00:16,219 --> 00:00:21,356
Good.
You're annoying.

5
00:00:21,703 --> 00:00:30,543
Ugh, I'm sleepy. Move— hurry.
Hey hey hey! Move, move, get out!

6
00:00:30,543 --> 00:00:34,577
Hey— did you just kick your own brother?
I'm sleepy. Move.

7
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:40,800
This kid…

8
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:05,135
You guys are here?
Petch.

9
00:01:05,135 --> 00:01:09,762
No need. I just brought him to get his phone.
I'm leaving right after.

10
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:17,840
Alright, Petch— bring the phone.

11
00:01:19,050 --> 00:01:23,650
Mm.
Thank you.

12
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:30,115
Are you sick or something? Usually you—

13
00:01:30,115 --> 00:01:36,902
I'm fine. He's fine, everything's normal.
Earth, let's go— hey.

14
00:01:36,902 --> 00:01:41,183
Aren't you staying a bit?
Stop talking. Move.
